      "notes": "All targets extracted from May 2023 science-based decarbonisation targets announcement and detailed 2023 Sustainability Report. Multiple sector-specific targets exist with both near-term (2030) and long-term (2040/2050) milestones. Quantifiable metrics provided for all targets including percentage reductions and alignment delta thresholds. Baseline years and values provided for all financed emissions targets. Oil & Gas sector excludes new project financing for upstream projects approved after 2021. Shipping sector uses alignment delta metric per IMO revised trajectory. Carbon neutrality for operational emissions is maintained as an ongoing target for 2023.",
